    "updated_at": "2026-05-06T09:12:24Z",
    "body": "I think the spec as it was written did not include workers initially so we did not think about it. I haven't done the worker part of the spec so I am not sure how it works. I do support including the cross-origin isolation mode (and probably the origin that sets COI) in the agent cluster key. This is what we're doing in our DocumentIsolationPolicy proposal and how COI is actually implemented in Chrome. We bundled the coi mode + coi origin in an optional cross-origin isolation key that can be set on agent clustered keys.",
