    "created_at": "2026-05-08T16:13:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-08T16:13:59Z",
    "body": "This might not actually be a problem for the specification given that a shared/service worker already always has its own agent cluster. Whether it's cross-origin isolated or not, it's always unique anyway. And the way COOP + COEP work with browsing context groups it's the same deal there I think.",
